{
  "slug": "stitch-to-nextjs",
  "name": "Stitch To Nextjs",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Convert Google Stitch designs into pixel-perfect Next.js + Tailwind CSS components. Extracts exact HTML/CSS, downloads images, maps all 29 Stitch fonts to next/font/google, preserves exact colors and spacing (never rounds to Tailwind defaults), and auto-configures the stitch-mcp server for HTML code export and screenshot validation. Supports ShadCN/UI mapping, Tailwind v3/v4, and Server Components.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `stitch-to-nextjs` (Convert Stitch designs into pixel-perfect Next.js + Tailwind components) and **1 MCP server**, `stitch-dev`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install stitch-to-nextjs@claude-community` from `yshaish1/stitch-to-nextjs`.\n\nWhen you convert Stitch designs to code manually or with generic AI tools, things drift:",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
